      "value": "Many times, the imposter will generate a broken avatar (doesn't show clothes, hair not attached to head, big spikes on arms, etc). Imposters also don't have vismes, facial expressions, or hand gestures. Imposters are inferior to fallbacks in every way. Do not replace fallbacks with imposters.",
