      "reactions": {
        "like": 1
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I very much love my fallback avatar, and with the love and effort I pour into it, I wish to be able to keep making and using them. \n\nAt current however with the changes made, it is annoying to swap between my imposters. I use 2 \"main\" avatars; one human and one robotic, and I worked hard to make Fallback versions of each, but swapping between them requires me to go to the website.\n\nI suggest having a button for valid avatars in the avatar selection menu to swap between fallbacks. Somewhere around where the current \"view fallback\" button is on that menu.\n\nOverall I wish for the Fallback Avatars to remain a feature for those who upload one.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
